rows=[dict(key='master',slug='2026-11-reading-masters-excellence-2027',title='Reading碩士學費減免：2027/28學年£4,000至£10,000',en='Reading master’s tuition awards: £4,000–£10,000 for 2027/28',tail='masters-excellence-scholarships',level=('碩士','Master’s'),funding=('首年學費£4,000／£9,000／£10,000','First-year tuition: £4,000 / £9,000 / £10,000'),deadline=('獲獎接受期限2027-06-30；7月起依錄取日起8週','Accept by June 30, 2027; later offers have eight weeks'),second='https://nbyula.com/study-abroad/university-of-reading/scholarships/master-s-excellence-scholarship/',paras=[
('可以減少哪些費用','What the award covers','Reading大學2027/28碩士Excellence獎學金依前一學位成績，提供首年學費減免：英國First或同等£10,000、2:1或同等£9,000、2:2或同等£4,000。沒有現金替代，也不能支付課程訂金；生活費與其餘學費仍須另外準備。台灣成績如何對應由校方認定，不能自行把某個百分數換算成保證金額。','Reading’s 2027/28 Master’s Excellence Scholarship reduces first-year tuition by £10,000 for a First-equivalent degree, £9,000 for a 2:1 or £4,000 for a 2:2. It is not cash and cannot pay a course deposit. Living costs and remaining fees require separate funding. Reading determines the equivalence of Taiwanese qualifications; no local percentage guarantees a tier.'),
('台灣學生的適用條件','Conditions for Taiwanese applicants','須為國際學費身分，申請合適的MA、研究型MA、MSc、MRes或LLM，並獲正式入學錄取，最低達2:2同等成績。全時及一般兼讀可評估，雙聯與彈性／模組兼讀排除；已有全額學費資助不適用。官方台灣頁接受台灣學歷作入學評估，但課程門檻與獎學金等第仍由校方分別確認。','Applicants need international fee status, an eligible MA, MA by Research, MSc, MRes or LLM offer, and at least a 2:2-equivalent degree. Full-time and ordinary part-time routes qualify for consideration; dual and flexible/modular routes do not. Full tuition sponsorship excludes eligibility. Reading’s Taiwan page recognises Taiwanese qualifications for admission, while course entry and award classification remain separate assessments.'),
('申請與接受期限','Application and acceptance','不須另填獎學金申請表，隨課程申請與成績資料自動評估，金額須見於錄取信。2027年6月30日是前期獲獎者接受獎項的期限，不是所有課程共同的申請截止；7月起獲獎者依正式條款有錄取日起8週接受期。課程本身期限及訂金仍須遵守。','No separate scholarship form is required: assessment uses the degree application and transcript, with funding confirmed in the offer. June 30, 2027 is the acceptance deadline for earlier scholarship offers, not a universal course-application deadline. Later awards have an eight-week acceptance period under the terms. Course deadlines and deposit obligations remain applicable.'),
('學年與併領限制','Intake and combinations','本項涵蓋2027年9月或2028年2月入學，不能套用到2027年2月；後者使用舊年度方案。不可與Reading校友或合作夥伴獎相加；外部部分補助依條款可搭配，但合計不得超過當年學費。當日已實讀2027/28四頁正式條款，外部Nbyula資料交叉確認金額與期限；官方主頁部分連結仍指舊條款，因此本頁明列新年度文件。','This scheme covers September 2027 or February 2028, not February 2027, which uses the older scheme. Reading Alumni and Partner awards replace rather than stack with Excellence; partial external funding is permitted within the annual tuition ceiling. We read the four-page 2027/28 terms and cross-checked values and timing with Nbyula. Some links on the main university page still point to older terms, so the correct document is supplied explicitly.')]),
dict(key='ug',slug='2026-11-reading-undergraduate-excellence-2027',title='Reading學士Excellence獎學金：每年£5,000，首輪至12月底',en='Reading Undergraduate Excellence Scholarship: £5,000 annually, first round through December',tail='undergraduate-excellence-scholarship-2027',level=('學士／整合碩士','Undergraduate / integrated master’s'),funding=('每年學費£5,000；依正式條件','£5,000 annual tuition support, subject to terms'),deadline=('首輪2026-12-31；後續輪次見內文','First round December 31, 2026; later rounds below'),second=mie,paras=[
('減輕每年學費','Reducing annual tuition','Reading的2027本科Excellence獎提供每年£5,000學費減免，面向國際學費學生的合適學士及整合碩士課程。這是依學業表現競爭的獎項，不能將取得錄取、填完表格或符合基本門檻等同獲獎，也不包含生活費全額補助。每年給付仍以正式獎項條件為準。','Reading’s 2027 Undergraduate Excellence Scholarship offers £5,000 per year toward tuition on eligible undergraduate and integrated master’s courses for international fee payers. It is competitive and merit-based: admission, a completed form or basic eligibility does not guarantee selection. It does not fully fund living costs, and annual support remains subject to the formal award conditions.'),
('台灣資格與申請方式','Taiwan eligibility and application','須取得合適2027/28本科課程錄取並按國際生費率繳費，再依邀請經申請人入口填表。官方台灣入學頁接受台灣申請者並說明學歷路徑；本獎未列台灣排除。仍須滿足課程學術與英語條件。不可與Global Sustainability Leaders Scholarship同時持有。','Applicants need an eligible 2027/28 undergraduate offer and international fee status, then complete the form through the applicant portal when invited. The university’s Taiwan admissions page describes recognised entry routes, and this award does not exclude Taiwan. Course-specific academic and English requirements apply. It cannot be held alongside the Global Sustainability Leaders Scholarship.'),
('目前開放的輪次','Current application rounds','第一輪為2026年9月1日至12月31日，預計2027年1月28日通知；第二輪1月至3月31日、第三輪4月至6月30日，另有7月至8月20日的Clearing輪次。今天11月9日仍在首輪內。這些獎項輪次不取代課程本身或UCAS適用期限，請保留入口提交紀錄。','The first round runs from September 1 to December 31, 2026, with decisions expected January 28, 2027. Later rounds run January–March 31 and April–June 30, followed by a July–August 20 Clearing round. November 9 falls within round one. These funding rounds do not replace course or UCAS deadlines; retain evidence of submission.'),
('已確認與待公布的範圍','Confirmed information and pending details','MIE Connect外部名錄確認£5,000與國際生範圍，年度時程以校方2027頁為準。官方在本次查核時仍把完整條款標為待確認，因此不能自行補寫續領成績、支付方式或所有課程排除清單；得獎前應讀更新條款及正式通知。這不影響現行首輪入口已開放的事實，但會影響家庭能否把多年補助全部算入預算。','MIE Connect corroborates the £5,000 headline value and international scope; the university’s 2027 page supplies the dates. Full terms were still marked to be confirmed when checked. We therefore do not invent progression grades, payment mechanics or a complete exclusion list. Read updated terms and the formal award notice before budgeting for several years of support.')]),
dict(key='palmer',slug='2026-11-reading-frank-palmer-february-2027',title='Reading語言教學碩士Frank Palmer獎：學費減10%，11月15日條件期限',en='Reading Frank Palmer Award: 10% tuition discount, November 15 conditions deadline',tail='frank-palmer-award',level=('應用語言學／TESOL碩士','Applied Linguistics / TESOL master’s'),funding=('學費減免10%','10% tuition reduction'),deadline=('2026-11-15 23:59英國時間','November 15, 2026, 23:59 UK time'),second='https://www.ultimateducation.co.id/beasiswa/international-scholarships-university-of-reading',paras=[
('適合哪些學習方向','Relevant study routes','Frank Palmer Award為Reading英語與應用語言學系的MA Applied Linguistics及MA TESOL提供10%學費折扣，針對表現優秀的錄取者。這兩個課程分別關注語言研究與對非英語母語者的英語教學；獎項不是所有Reading碩士都適用，也不是保證提供教師工作或教學證照。','The Frank Palmer Award offers a 10% tuition discount for promising offer-holders on Reading’s MA Applied Linguistics and MA TESOL. These routes concern language research and teaching English to speakers of other languages. The award does not cover every Reading master’s course or guarantee employment or a teaching licence.'),
('現在仍可完成的申請路徑','The currently open route','本次確認的是2027年2月入學：須在2026年11月15日23:59英國時間以前取得錄取、接受錄取並滿足所有附帶條件。該日英國使用GMT，對應台北11月16日07:59。這是全部條件完成期限，不是只要當天開始填入學申請就可以；尚未有錄取者應先確認審理是否來得及。','The verified open route is February 2027 entry. By November 15, 2026 at 23:59 UK time, applicants must have received and accepted an offer and met all remaining conditions. Under GMT this is November 16 at 07:59 in Taipei. It is a completion deadline, not permission to start an admission application at the last minute; applicants without an offer should check processing feasibility.'),
('台灣學生與資助限制','Taiwan eligibility and funding restrictions','官方條件未限定特定國籍，台灣學歷另有正式入學說明；外部MIE名錄列國際學生可申請。須符合課程學術、英語及錄取條件，完全獎學金持有人及受贊助學生不適用。這裡的受贊助排除不能自行縮小成只有全額贊助才排除；若有其他資助，先向系所確認。','The official rules are not restricted to a named nationality, and Taiwan has a published admissions route; MIE’s external catalogue lists international eligibility. Course, English and offer conditions still apply. Full scholarship holders and sponsored students are excluded. The sponsored-student exclusion should not be narrowed without confirmation; applicants with other support should consult the department.'),
('查核與預算提醒','Verification and budgeting','校方頁與Ultimate Education名錄均列10%及11月15日的2027年2月條件期限，另以MIE交叉確認獎項存在及範圍。舊的9月2026期限已過，不列為開放。官方沒有保證每位符合條件者都得到折扣；其他獎項能否併領、正式金額及付款安排須以校方答覆為準，家庭仍須準備其餘90%學費和生活費。','Reading and Ultimate Education both identify the 10% award and November 15 conditions deadline for February 2027; MIE corroborates the award and scope. The September 2026 deadline has passed and is not presented as open. Eligibility does not establish a guaranteed award. Confirm combinations, amount and payment arrangements with the university, and budget for remaining tuition and living costs.')])]
