 desc='經當日官方與外部來源核對，台灣學生可依課程與資助條件接受評估；非保證得獎。';de='Checked against official and external sources today. Taiwanese applicants may qualify subject to course and funding conditions; selection is not guaranteed.'
 sources=[('Reading — current award page',base+x['tail']),('External award information',x['second']),('Reading — Taiwan entry information',tw)]
